---
import { SETORA_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE, SETORA_FACTS_CHECKED_ISO, SETORA_SOURCES, SETORA_TRADEMARK_DISCLAIMER } from '@/lib/seo/setoraFacts';
import { SETORA_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_ISO, SETORA_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_LABEL } from '@/lib/seo/setoraAlternativeFaq';
---
<section id="sources" class="fresha-alt-sources" aria-labelledby="setora-alt-sources-title"><div class="container">
<header class="fresha-alt-sources__header"><h2 id="setora-alt-sources-title" class="fresha-alt-sources__title">Sources &amp; comparison notes</h2>
<p class="fresha-alt-sources__meta">Setora facts checked <time datetime={SETORA_FACTS_CHECKED_ISO}>{SETORA_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE}</time><span aria-hidden="true">·</span>Last updated <time datetime={SETORA_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_ISO}>{SETORA_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_LABEL}</time></p></header>
<p>This comparison draws on Setora's published UK pricing, features and Help Centre. Setora's current main pricing page shows £59/month per location, while some other Setora pages still display £39. We use the official main pricing page as the current rate and disclose the discrepancy. Pricing and features can change; confirm current terms with Setora before choosing a platform.</p>
<ul class="fresha-alt-sources__list">{SETORA_SOURCES.map(source=><li><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{source.label}</a><span class="fresha-alt-sources__supports">{source.supports}</span></li>)}</ul>
<p class="fresha-alt-sources__trademark">{SETORA_TRADEMARK_DISCLAIMER}</p>
</div></section>